 "name_en": "Universal Allocation (2QL)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Universal Allocation (2QL)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio7e37fdbf3b2340398ccc30a9f4689538\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7e37fdbf3b2340398ccc30a9f4689538__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The Universal Allocation scope item covers plan and actual allocations. For plan allocations of cost centers in overhead cost controlling, it covers the upload of cost center plan data and the execution of the plan allocation cycles. Annual planning is supported via cost redistribution through defined allocation cycles, by definition of sender and receiver rules by fixed amount and percentage. You can control your costs and compare plan and actual costs by allocating the cost elements to cost centers in overhead cost controlling. For examples of actual allocations, see the Overhead Cost Accounting (J54) test script. Profit centers are also covered.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7e37fdbf3b2340398ccc30a9f4689538__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Import financial plan data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Upload statistical key figure plan data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute cost center actual and plan assessment cycles</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute plan and actual profit center distributions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Run plan data reports for cost centers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">View plan and actual profit center distributions</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7e37fdbf3b2340398ccc30a9f4689538__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Gain better control of costs with visibility into how actual costs compare with plan</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>通用分配 (2QL)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio7e37fdbf3b2340398ccc30a9f4689538\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7e37fdbf3b2340398ccc30a9f4689538__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通用分配范围项目涵盖计划和实际分配。对于间接费用成本控制中成本中心的计划分配，它涵盖了成本中心计划数据的上载和计划分配周期的执行。通过按固定金额和百分比定义发送方和接收方规则，通过定义的分配周期内的成本重新分配支持年度计划。通过将成本要素分配到间接费用成本控制中的成本中心，可以控制成本并比较计划成本和实际成本。有关实际分配的示例，请参阅间接费用成本会计 (J54) 测试脚本。利润中心也包括在内。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7e37fdbf3b2340398ccc30a9f4689538__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">导入财务计划数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">上载统计关键指标计划数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行成本中心实际和计划分摊周期</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行计划和实际利润中心分配</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">运行成本中心的计划数据报表</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">查看计划和实际利润中心分配</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7e37fdbf3b2340398ccc30a9f4689538__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过了解实际成本与计划之间的对比情况，更好地控制成本</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
